% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


publish is identified by "http://example.org/Publish".

publish is an action.

publish has the result annual interoperability report.


annual interoperability report is identified by "http://example.org/AnnualInteroperabilityReport".

annual interoperability report is an action result type.

annual interoperability report has the label "Annual report on interoperability in the Union".

annual interoperability report has the result category report.


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query results is:
    which action has the result which result.

query result_categories is:
    which result has the result category which category.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

